# Playwright / e2e run output. These carried over from the pre-split tree, where the web sat at
# the repository root and **/ covered them; in this repository the web lives under web/, so the
# patterns are anchored to that path. Measured after an e2e run: 10.4 MB across 152 files
# (playwright-report 1.1, test-results 0.8, e2e/artifacts 7.5, tmp 0.3, e2e/.artifacts 0.7), none
# of it ignored. playwright-report and test-results can carry traces of a session, so this is
# also the reason they must not be committed rather than merely the reason they are large.
web/fusion-rpg-web/playwright-report/
web/fusion-rpg-web/test-results/
web/fusion-rpg-web/tmp/
web/fusion-rpg-web/e2e/artifacts/
web/fusion-rpg-web/e2e/.artifacts/
.playwright-cli/
.playwright-mcp/
